                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex 3—Translation]<anchor n="55" xml:id="d294-f1"
                        /></seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Proposed Addition to the Proposed
                    Resolution</hi></head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Whereas</hi>: this Second Consultative Meeting of the
                    Ministers for Foreign Affairs of the American Republics has defined in a solemn
                    Declaration the dangers which threaten this Hemisphere in the political
                    situation of the American regions belonging to European countries. (This will be
                    the first whereas.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
